# REQUIRES: uv
# The compiler-configuration identity has two independent legs: the
# provider binds every configured ExactRef to the exact environment it was
# constructed over, and the reference twin recomputes the same digests from
# the same registries. Byte agreement here is the parity gate; the golden
# values pinned in pir-compiler-provider.mlir remain the change tripwire.

